  message: "FOLD 2026-09-30 (owner delegated the decision): WI-tabig-botud (P4, filed 09-07) is folded INTO this item as a duplicate in mechanism. This item survives because it carries the measured value (+32 ORM edges from `fees` alone on pretix) and the current premise check.\nWhat WI-tabig contributes, now part of this item's scope:\n- A SECOND instance of the same shape: pretix `OrderPosition.checkins` is a @property returning `self.all_checkins(manager='objects')` (FK `Checkin.position`, related_name=\"all_checkins\"). Call sites recorded on WI-tabig: pdf.py:732/736, services/checkin.py:1110/1119 (`op.checkins.all()/.filter()/.order_by()`). WI-gulaz correctly refuses to type `op.checkins` today (the class does not own that accessor).\n- A candidate MECHANISM: type `<instance>.<property>` through the property-getter return path -- `_build_property_getter_index` (py.py:3754, from WI-gubar) already indexes getters for `references` edges. Bound it to a getter with exactly ONE `return` whose expression is a manager root or a QuerySet-returning chain under the oracle; anything else refuses. This is the same rule this item states: adjudicate on the RETURN EXPRESSION, never the name.\n- WI-tabig's sizing ask stands: count @property getters on model classes whose return is an ORM chain (pretix, django) and measure with measurement 0003's method before building."  # 71bf
